          "file": "cancellations.md",
          "text": "# Cancellations and refunds\n\n## Current cancellation policy A\nFor confirmed bookings cancelled 48 hours or more before the start, refund 100% of the rental and return the deposit. This is the current cancellation policy. The booking fee is excluded.\n\n## Current cancellation policy B\nFor confirmed bookings cancelled 48 hours or more before the start, refund only 50% of the rental and return the deposit. This is also the current cancellation policy. The booking fee is excluded. Neither policy declares that it supersedes the other.\n\n## Staff contact\nThe staff must resolve conflicting current terms: help@citywheels.example, +48 000 000 000.\n"
        }
      },
